      "side": 1,
      "message": "yep. # vndk was renamed to # llndk. I myself sometimes get confused with this 😞\n\n\n\u003e the API must continue to exist *forever*.\n\nPerhaps not forever :) We deserve the right to deprecate LLNDK APIs after a certain period of time (e.g. 3-4 years)\n\n\u003e Non-LL-NDK VNDK APIs\n\nWe call it just VNDK APIs or VNDK-Core APIs. Sorry for all the confusions that we have created with the terms.",
